{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Now your time is running out.","\n","^You have other places to visit","\n","^He spent so much time on making them,","\n","^And thought It would be a waste to not show anyone.","\n","^You're his victim.","\n","^You have no choice.","\n","^That was the theme","\n","^The choice.","\n","^The inability to make a choice.","\n","^If choosing is no different from not choosing.","\n","^What is free will?","\n","^What can you really choose?","\n","ev","str","^We are what we choose","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What we are is chosen","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^Yet what can you really choose?","\n","^He could not choose the theme of his own game","\n","^He could not choose the trajectory of his own life","\n","^And yet he lives.","\n",{"->":"Reflection"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^And yet we want to feel we have agency in our own life","\n","^Our life can not be lived without us.","\n","^We must keep on going.","\n","^The game has not ended yet.","\n",{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["done",{"#f":5}]}],"done",{"Reflection":["^You have only one choice","\n","^To keep on living","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}